{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bloodlit",
    "steam_appid": 3700000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/7a3ad1f69e0c796dfefd3efa79c20dd5.avif?t=1753762472\" width=798 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join our official Discord for the latest updates! Feel free to engage with the development by providing your feedback and following plans for the future of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bloodlit</strong></i> is a <strong>first-person shooter</strong>\u00a0designed to unite slow-paced oppressive <strong>survival horror</strong> tension with fast-paced reflex-driven <strong>close-quarters combat</strong>, demanding a relentless, evolving style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game places players at a stark disadvantage from the beginning \u2014 outnumbered, under-equipped, and vulnerable. Success hinges on quick thinking and flawless execution: parry enemy attacks with precision, strike back in brief stun windows, and exploit enemy weaknesses to claw out a few precious seconds of breathing room. Mastery of <i>Bloodlit</i> is not just mechanical \u2014 it is mental, requiring players to process information rapidly and adapt their tactics moment to moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/846cbc49ba4b659b9833a42ad4614ffb.webp?t=1753762472\" width=212 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies in <i>Bloodlit</i> are relentless and overwhelming. To survive, one must maintain control of imminent danger and chaos without collapsing under the endless pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a test of endurance and focus. Let your guard down for even a moment, and their attacks will hit the hardest when you're the most exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/6c4e1aa015c2408df9108760546b02e2.poster.avif?t=1753762472\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/6c4e1aa015c2408df9108760546b02e2.webm?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/6c4e1aa015c2408df9108760546b02e2.mp4?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/50645fabc73bff3e4efbda1d8670727e.avif?t=1753762472\" width=226 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Bloodlit</i> is up close, tense, and technical. Attacks can be countered with precise timing and enemies can be staggered to open up a narrow window to strike back. These follow-up attacks aren't just flashy \u2014 they\u2019re often the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being outnumbered and surrounded <strong>is well expected</strong>. Players must rely on sharp reflexes and quick judgment to turn the tide, especially when enemies get closer than comfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/26ddcf4eb0162daa18b3882a3d4593bb.poster.avif?t=1753762472\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/26ddcf4eb0162daa18b3882a3d4593bb.webm?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/26ddcf4eb0162daa18b3882a3d4593bb.mp4?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/e03d2f77005a76a1fd67a9969ba8124c.avif?t=1753762472\" width=256 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon in <i>Bloodlit</i> is crafted with a clear purpose. Whether it\u2019s raw close-range firepower, precise long-range control, or tools designed to break enemy defenses and set up for melee finishers, each one offers a unique tactical edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the tools that suit your instincts, learn their strengths, and push them to their limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/8f579be45216487c4b27c676fbb2d4a2.poster.avif?t=1753762472\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/8f579be45216487c4b27c676fbb2d4a2.webm?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700000/extras/8f579be45216487c4b27c676fbb2d4a2.mp4?t=1753762472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8\u2ad8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet no matter how skilled you become, escape is an illusion. You are trapped in a cycle of endless violence and suffering \u2014 a nightmare you cannot wake from. Because here, in this place drenched in blood, you are not the victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the architect of your own suffering.</p>",
